\subsection{Temporal Displacement and Mathematical Prescience}

The forecasts share a common pattern---double-digit CAGRs attributed to e-commerce growth,
post-pandemic labor shortages, and demand for same-day fulfilment---with indoor mobile robots
and AMRs as the core technology. The consistency of the direction across independent firms is
more informative than any single figure.

